{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "36b09d22ed41d43757860aa1bc24c16920b8145c599d909933fa27b57da0d39a", "ja": "（今日は亜美の野外ライブ。普段の元気な調子から\n一転、しっとりしたバラードを、見事に歌い上げた！）", "zh": "（今天是亚美的户外演出。她一改平时活力满满的风格，精彩地唱完了一首抒情曲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "e5ab3b20577941bfbedcfbbeadd4fec8783a419ccd96e7929119661298bb2d00", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃ……じゃなくて！　コホン。\nお兄さま。今日のライブ、とっても素敵でしたわね？", "zh": "啊，哥哥……不对！咳咳。  \n兄长大人，今天的演唱会真是精彩呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9b507391581e7e2bd7d09e6f3a5903a8d373a9b6ec38ca13091caa18a85a84c8", "ja": "あ、ああ、そう思うけど、なんだそのキャラ……？\nもしかして、歌に合わせてか。", "zh": "啊，嗯，我也是这么想的，不过你这是在演哪一出……？\n难道是配合歌曲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "8042e8663247facb4994fac4271580b12f76b7e81cad0b1832868d0f86407b09", "ja": "え？　亜美、いつもこんな感じですわよ～？\nエレガンスでガンスよ～、おほほほ。", "zh": "诶？亚美平时就是这个样子呀～？\n这叫优雅风格啦～，哦呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dbc3ad1126d2a8063b1c42e48ea626f84e79243a68649fafdb10481d4242c4a5", "ja": "さっそくボロが……\n無理するなって。もうライブ終わったんだから。", "zh": "这就露馅了……\n别勉强了，演出都已经结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "b5ef6b12c8000495dc8f955c9df0d6e20289a1df094cff508e19e0757aaa1f51", "ja": "うあうあ～、もうちょっとつきあってくれても\nいいじゃん！　兄ちゃんのイケズ！", "zh": "哇啊哇啊～，稍微配合一下人家\n又不会怎样嘛！兄哥真小气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eb4ba55ed62272d15c26f71a8b5afce62bcda1357b35c64909d7eefe998fc425", "ja": "ノッた方がよかったのか……ゴメン。\nでも、ライブがよかったのは本当だからな！", "zh": "跟着起哄一下会比较好吗……抱歉。\n不过，演唱会很精彩是真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "1ba5dd094db175961b6c2df872124256e86cfb65059f529e14d15c1ae7d37a86", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　でしょでしょ？\n会場のみんなもメロメロンにしちゃったよね♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪　是吧是吧？\n全场的大家也都被我迷得神魂颠倒了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "373325408a64cab22c48e1f0bca05e99215df8bfefc1c86f5bd60fb2f3d920ba", "ja": "どう？　兄ちゃんも亜美の歌を聴いて、\nドーキがドキドキしちゃった？", "zh": "怎么样？哥哥听了亚美的歌，心跳也怦怦加速了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "edba57d729d58c139875500cc3b3e7e11734ce05a5155a07e1efcccd46b2307f", "ja": "まあな、想像以上によかったよ。\n亜美は、どんなことを考えながら歌ってたんだ？", "zh": "确实，超出了我的想象呢。\n亚美当时是一边想着什么一边唱的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "624e9e7450f1b595b984be7939a2e0d282af9ccd729d20e1b8480427d69fc9bc", "ja": "え、どんなことって……\nチッチッチ、そいつはいくらなんでもナイショだぜ？", "zh": "诶，什么样的事……  \n啧啧啧，这种事无论如何都要保密啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "876e8b0c184b4c57b03a2d39fbf2de03761cff97464ebc399e4e9916d8f7a109", "ja": "……あ、もしかして！　亜美が兄ちゃんのことを\n考えながら歌ったとか、そういうのを期待してたり？", "zh": "……啊，难道说！哥哥是期待着，亚美一边想着哥哥，一边唱歌之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "a543f01d066a0ce96b6d7dc3d023273d7e49ba951d72bffc649d721720a9e997", "ja": "だとしたら……ドンマイ。\nオトナな亜美は、兄ちゃんにはまだ早いっぽいよ～。", "zh": "要是那样的话……那就遗憾啦。\n成熟的亚美，对哥哥来说好像还太早了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "28ee2bf4a02d16f80cb499ba1b1d3c15f86e5e9daf6a036594f9154452185aaf", "ja": "いや、そんなことまったく考えてないが……。\n本当にうまかったから、気になったんだよ。", "zh": "不，我完全没那么想过就是了……\n我是因为唱得真的很棒，所以有些好奇罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2e0c765dc8982a949d4cc2ead2fadc507d8ff5460266ef26b2b3347d23ea4d62", "ja": "繊細な恋心とか、どうやって表現したのかなって。\n後学のために、聞いておきたくて。", "zh": "我想知道你是怎么表现出那种细腻的恋爱情感的。为了以后学习，想先问问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "86122446aae71b559ceba5473220e3d4198d84bae5da80b1b3438dbe8151c30f", "ja": "それはもう……経験だよ、兄ちゃん。\n亜美にだってトキめく瞬間はあるのであるからして。", "zh": "那当然是……经验啦，哥哥。  \n毕竟亚美也有心动的瞬间嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b722a48b53fc850ae0abdec2a43c9a0359a1f807e621139f67b6b5ac8bb86ff1", "ja": "トキめく瞬間……たとえば？", "zh": "心动的瞬间……比如说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "aaf5040c0d0b4ee41d24f11d3cad8ea697c175c37a881b170e2b330436afbc8f", "ja": "新しいイタズラを思いついたり、それを仕掛けた時の\n兄ちゃんの反応を想像したりー、めちゃドキっしょ！", "zh": "比如想到了新的恶作剧，或是想象着对\n老哥使出来时老哥的反应～超让人心跳加速的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "163a2ec68d03da6afb7e8b29fe1001697f68c27edf136c8752918050a62df1c9", "ja": "へぇ、イタズラがためになるとは……。\nそれで、次はどんなイタズラを？", "zh": "哦，没想到恶作剧也能派上用场……那么，接下来要搞什么恶作剧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "245f16d7fc4dd3c127cb7b4bc3e3f8135a54fa274ac0bd5e7773758452814b54", "ja": "んっふっふ！　それはね、兄ちゃんのカバンの……\nって、危ない！　ネタバレするとこだよ！", "zh": "嗯哼哼！那个嘛，是关于哥哥的包——\n\n啊，危险！差点就剧透了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "3bc8ffade24dce62de9ea34175367c879be88ebe3e436afd9f5f02e105006e90", "ja": "兄ちゃんはまったく、油断もスキもありませんな～。\nその手にはひっかからないよ、アデューっ！", "zh": "哥哥真是的，完全不给人可乘之机呢～  \n我才不会上你的当呢，拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0354_1021_p", "source_sha256": "db52aeb3a51066557a5203cd34ec4e1f78e35f098f1d6c9656d76bf022e360ba", "ja": "（くっ、逃げられた……カバンがどうなるんだろう？\n気を付けておかないとな）", "zh": "（可恶，被她逃掉了……不知道包会变成什么样？得多加注意才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
